  "ftdLearningMessage": "You decide what to study. Add kanji by JLPT level or hand-pick individual characters. Spaced repetition tests you four ways — including drawing from memory, which builds the active recall that passive apps can't match.\n\nTrack your progress with detailed statistics.",
