  "ftdBrowserMessage": "Browse all Jōyō kanji in a searchable table. Filter by reading, meaning, or stroke count. Tap any kanji to see its detail — and choose which compound words (composita) you want in your reviews.\n\nColored dots show your review progress at a glance.",
