  "ftdReviewSessionMessage": "Four card types test different aspects of recall:\n• Draw from meaning — see the keyword, write the kanji from memory\n• Kanji recognition — see the kanji, recall its reading and meaning\n• Reading cloze — read a compound word in a real sentence\n• Draw in sentence — write a kanji in context\n\nDrawing from memory is harder than multiple choice — that's the point. Grade yourself with Again (missed) or Good (recalled).",
